      509.08,
      537.92,
      568.06
    ],
    "text": "Several spells of showers will occur in Western and Sabaragamuwa provinces and in Galle and Matara districts. A few showers may occur in North-western province.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      571.72,
      538.37,
      626.98
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thunder showers will occur at a several places in Central, Uva and Eastern provinces and in Polonnaruwa and Hambantota districts after 1.00 p.m. and, fairly heavy falls above 50 mm are likely at some places in these areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      631.03,
      413.54,
      655.06
    ],
    "text": "Mainly fair weather conditions are expected in other areas of the Island.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      658.48,
      538.3,
      777.41
